{"date":"2026-10-11","level":"n4_lite","title":"はじめての陶芸教室","text":"先週、はじめて陶芸教室に行ってみました。先生に教えてもらいながら、ゆっくり形を作りました。思っていたより難しくて、何度もやり直しました。それでも、自分で作ったお茶碗はとてもかわいくて、嬉しかったです。","tokens":[{"surface_form":"先週","basic_form":"先週","reading":"せんしゅう","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"、","basic_form":"、","reading":"、","pos":"記号"},{"surface_form":"はじめて","basic_form":"はじめて","reading":"はじめて","pos":"副詞"},{"surface_form":"陶芸教室","basic_form":"陶芸教室","reading":"とうげいきょうしつ","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"に","basic_form":"に","reading":"に","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"行ってみました","basic_form":"行く","reading":"いってみました","pos":"動詞"},{"surface_form":"。","basic_form":"。","reading":"。","pos":"記号"},{"surface_form":"先生","basic_form":"先生","reading":"せんせい","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"に","basic_form":"に","reading":"に","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"教えてもらいながら","basic_form":"教える","reading":"おしえてもらいながら","pos":"動詞"},{"surface_form":"、","basic_form":"、","reading":"、","pos":"記号"},{"surface_form":"ゆっくり","basic_form":"ゆっくり","reading":"ゆっくり","pos":"副詞"},{"surface_form":"形","basic_form":"形","reading":"かたち","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"を","basic_form":"を","reading":"を","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"作りました","basic_form":"作る","reading":"つくりました","pos":"動詞"},{"surface_form":"。","basic_form":"。","reading":"。","pos":"記号"},{"surface_form":"思っていた","basic_form":"思う","reading":"おもっていた","pos":"動詞"},{"surface_form":"より","basic_form":"より","reading":"より","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"難しくて","basic_form":"難しい","reading":"むずかしくて","pos":"形容詞"},{"surface_form":"、","basic_form":"、","reading":"、","pos":"記号"},{"surface_form":"何度","basic_form":"何度","reading":"なんど","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"も","basic_form":"も","reading":"も","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"やり直しました","basic_form":"やり直す","reading":"やりなおしました","pos":"動詞"},{"surface_form":"。","basic_form":"。","reading":"。","pos":"記号"},{"surface_form":"それでも","basic_form":"それでも","reading":"それでも","pos":"接続詞"},{"surface_form":"、","basic_form":"、","reading":"、","pos":"記号"},{"surface_form":"自分","basic_form":"自分","re